I reach Priya's building.
I go up by the lift and find her flat.
I ring the doorbell.
A minute later, Priya opens the door.
She sees me and smiles nicely.
"Welcome, Maya!"
"Come inside," Priya says.
I take off my shoes at the door and go into the house.
Her home is very beautiful.
"Thank you, Priya," I say.
"I have brought something for you."
I hand the box of sweets to her.
"I think that you like Kaju Katli," I say with a smile.
Priya sees the box and looks very happy.
"Oh wow!"
"Thank you so much, Maya," she says.
"Yes, this is my favorite sweet."
"Let's definitely eat this after dinner."
"I will keep this box in the fridge now."
"Come, first let's sit in the living room."
I nod and follow her inside.
